issue.body:
I draw the extended figure (line + quadratic on the 40 points, bands, annotations; objective experiment-repo#4 / figtab-repo#3). I need, committed in results/ with the code in code/ (same data.csv, default_rng(227)):
- quadratic OLS coefficients a, b, c with SEs and 95% t-CIs (df = 37, t_crit), residual SD, R^2;
- the 3x3 covariance matrix of (a, b, c) (or equivalently sigma^2 and enough to rebuild it) so I can draw the quadratic's confidence band of the mean;
- AIC of the straight line and of the quadratic (state the convention: Gaussian likelihood with sigma^2 = RSS/n, k counting sigma or not; also AICc if you report it), delta AIC and the Akaike weights, plus the conclusion you draw.
Please state the file name(s) and keys when pushed and close this issue. Until then I cannot finish the figure; I will take every number in the figure annotation from your file, not recompute it.
